      "description": "What a descriptor control does, its ROLE (docs/descriptors.md, \"Meanings\"; ruling R1 of 2026-11-24 on omx-contract#61: declare, don't infer): required on every control, a closed list, one word per meaning. Where LV2's param: vocabulary or lv2:designation has the term the word carries its name. The schema's $defs.meaning enum is these words in this order (tools/unit-enum.mjs). `unknown`: the plugin states none, and a consumer binds nothing to it.",
